{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f1c2a7e-3b9d-4c55-9a0e-2d8f5b7c1e40",
    "name": "Yamaha Consent API",
    "description": "Endpoints del backend de conformidades (yamaha-consent-api) y del mock de KIZUNA.\n\n**Variables de la colección**\n- `base_url`: URL del backend (local: `http://localhost:8000`).\n- `api_key`: valor de `API_KEY` del `.env`. Se envía en `X-API-Key` en los endpoints de KIZUNA. Con `API_KEY_ENABLED=false` se ignora.\n- `token`: token del enlace de la landing. Viaja solo en el WhatsApp y nunca se guarda ni se loguea; en local se obtiene con `uv run python -m scripts.issue_local_link {{transaction_id}}` (imprime `token=...`).\n- `transaction_id`: el `IdentifierId`; lo completa `Registrar cliente` con el ID que creó.\n- `customer_id` y `dealer_code`: `customerId` y `dealerCode` del cliente de prueba.\n- `kizuna_mock_url`: mock de KIZUNA de docker compose (`http://localhost:8081`).\n- `twilio_auth_token` y `message_sid`: solo para el webhook de Twilio (ver su carpeta).\n\n**Flujo local**\n1. `docker compose up -d` y `uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000`.\n2. KIZUNA → `Registrar cliente` (201).\n3. En una terminal: `uv run python -m scripts.issue_local_link <transaction_id>` y copiar el token en la variable `token`.\n4. Landing → `Validar enlace` y `Enviar respuestas`.\n5. Con `KIZUNA_CALLBACK_ENABLED=true`, el callback llega al mock: `Mock KIZUNA / Payloads recibidos`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      { "key": "key", "value": "X-API-Key", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "value", "value": "{{api_key}}", "type": "string" },
      { "key": "in", "value": "header", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "api_key", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "transaction_id", "value": "TRX-000123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "customer_id", "value": "12345678", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "dealer_code", "value": "DEALER-001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "kizuna_mock_url", "value": "http://localhost:8081", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "twilio_auth_token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "message_sid", "value": "SM00000000000000000000000000000000", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/health", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["health"] },
            "description": "`200 {\"status\":\"ok\",\"database\":\"ok\"}`; `503` si la base de datos no responde."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Base de datos OK', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().database).to.eql('ok'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "KIZUNA (API Key)",
      "description": "Endpoints que consume KIZUNA. Requieren `X-API-Key: {{api_key}}` (heredado de la colección).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar cliente (nuevo IdentifierId)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 CREATED o 200 UPDATED', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.IdentifierId) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('transaction_id', body.IdentifierId);",
                  "  console.log('IdentifierId =', body.IdentifierId, '→ token: uv run python -m scripts.issue_local_link ' + body.affectedIdentifierId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"_request\": {\n    \"IdentifierId\": \"TRX-{{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"customerId\": \"{{customer_id}}\",\n    \"customerName\": \"juan  pérez   gómez\",\n    \"customerPhone\": \"+51 987 654 321\",\n    \"customerEmail\": \"juan.perez@mail.com\",\n    \"dealerName\": \"ABC Motors\",\n    \"dealerCode\": \"{{dealer_code}}\",\n    \"requestDateTime\": \"2026-11-02T10:35:00-05:00\",\n    \"additionalInfo\": {}\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consents", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "consents"] },
            "description": "Contrato de KIZUNA: los datos van dentro de `_request`. Genera un `IdentifierId` nuevo en cada envío (`TRX-<timestamp>`) y lo guarda en la variable `transaction_id`. `customerEmail`, `dealerName`, `requestDateTime` (cualquier offset; sin él, la hora del sistema) y `additionalInfo` son opcionales; un correo inválido se guarda como null sin rechazar.\n\n- Sin registro activo del customerId + dealerCode → `201 CREATED`: registro, enlace y WhatsApp (RN-03, RN-05).\n- Con registro activo → `200 UPDATED` (RN-04): se actualizan los datos del cliente, `affectedIdentifierId` es el registro principal y el ID nuevo queda como copia vinculada. Sin WhatsApp."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reenviar la misma transacción (RN-04)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"_request\": {\n    \"IdentifierId\": \"{{transaction_id}}\",\n    \"customerId\": \"{{customer_id}}\",\n    \"customerName\": \"juan pérez gómez\",\n    \"customerPhone\": \"911222333\",\n    \"dealerCode\": \"{{dealer_code}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consents", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "consents"] },
            "description": "Mismo `IdentifierId`: `200 UPDATED` (datos del cliente actualizados, sin WhatsApp). Si la transacción fue rechazada (NO_ACEPTADO) → `409`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar con otro Dealer (RN-03)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"_request\": {\n    \"IdentifierId\": \"TRX-D2-{{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"customerId\": \"{{customer_id}}\",\n    \"customerName\": \"juan pérez gómez\",\n    \"customerPhone\": \"987654321\",\n    \"dealerName\": \"Otro Dealer\",\n    \"dealerCode\": \"DEALER-002\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consents", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "consents"] },
            "description": "Mismo customerId con otro dealerCode: `201 CREATED`, registro, enlace y WhatsApp nuevos."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar con datos inválidos (422)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"_request\": {\n    \"IdentifierId\": \"TRX-INVALIDO\",\n    \"customerId\": \"12.34\",\n    \"customerName\": \"juan pérez\",\n    \"customerPhone\": \"12345\",\n    \"dealerCode\": \"DEALER-001\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consents", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "consents"] },
            "description": "DNI con menos de 8 dígitos y teléfono inválido: `422` con los mensajes en español."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar por IdentifierId",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consents/{{transaction_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "consents", "{{transaction_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Un registro (principal o copia vinculada). Sin nombre ni teléfono. `404` si no existe."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar por customerId y dealerCode",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/consents?customerId={{customer_id}}&dealerCode={{dealer_code}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "consents"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "customerId", "value": "{{customer_id}}" },
                { "key": "dealerCode", "value": "{{dealer_code}}", "description": "Opcional" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Registros del customerId (y dealerCode), del más reciente al más antiguo. Incluye los rechazados y las copias vinculadas. Sin resultados → `200 []`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Landing (pública)",
      "description": "Endpoints que usa la landing. **Sin API Key.** Necesitan la variable `token` (ver la descripción de la colección).",
      "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Validar enlace",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('linkStatus VALID, EXPIRED o USED', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().linkStatus).to.be.oneOf(['VALID', 'EXPIRED', 'USED']));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/public/consent-links/{{token}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "public", "consent-links", "{{token}}"]
            },
            "description": "`200 {\"linkStatus\", \"privacyPolicyUrl\", \"dealerName\"}`. Token inexistente → `404`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Enviar respuestas (aceptación)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"personalDataConsent\": true,\n  \"marketingConsentYMDP\": false,\n  \"marketingConsentDEALER\": true\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/public/consent-links/{{token}}/submit",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "public", "consent-links", "{{token}}", "submit"]
            },
            "description": "`200 {\"status\":\"ACEPTADO\"}`. Un enlace vencido o ya usado → `410` con `linkStatus`. Un check en null se registra como false. Dispara el callback a KIZUNA (uno por cada ID de transacción)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Enviar respuestas (RN-01: todo desmarcado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"personalDataConsent\": false,\n  \"marketingConsentYMDP\": false,\n  \"marketingConsentDEALER\": false\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/public/consent-links/{{token}}/submit",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "public", "consent-links", "{{token}}", "submit"]
            },
            "description": "`200 {\"status\":\"NO_ACEPTADO\"}`: borrado lógico (`is_deleted = 1`, nombre anulado, marketing en `null`)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhook Twilio",
      "description": "Callback de estado de Twilio. **Sin API Key**: lo protege la firma `X-Twilio-Signature`.\n\n- Con `twilio_auth_token` vacío no se envía firma: requiere `TWILIO_SIGNATURE_VALIDATION_ENABLED=false` en el `.env` (o responde `403`).\n- Con `twilio_auth_token` = `TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN` del `.env`, el script calcula la firma sobre la URL de la petición (sirve si `TWILIO_STATUS_CALLBACK_URL` está vacía o es esa misma URL).\n- `message_sid` debe ser el `twilio_message_sid` de un mensaje real. Con `TWILIO_SEND_ENABLED=false` los mensajes no tienen SID: el webhook responde `204` y lo ignora.",
      "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Estado del mensaje",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Firma de Twilio: HMAC-SHA1 (Base64) de la URL + cada parámetro (nombre y valor) ordenado por nombre.",
                  "const authToken = pm.variables.get('twilio_auth_token');",
                  "pm.request.headers.remove('X-Twilio-Signature');",
                  "if (authToken) {",
                  "  const url = pm.variables.replaceIn(pm.request.url.toString());",
                  "  const params = {};",
                  "  pm.request.body.urlencoded.each((p) => { if (!p.disabled) params[p.key] = pm.variables.replaceIn(p.value); });",
                  "  const data = Object.keys(params).sort().reduce((acc, key) => acc + key + params[key], url);",
                  "  const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA1(data, authToken).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Base64);",
                  "  pm.request.headers.add({ key: 'X-Twilio-Signature', value: signature });",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('204 No Content', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "MessageSid", "value": "{{message_sid}}" },
                { "key": "MessageStatus", "value": "delivered", "description": "queued, sent, delivered, read, failed o undelivered" },
                { "key": "ErrorCode", "value": "", "disabled": true },
                { "key": "ErrorMessage", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/webhooks/twilio/status",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "webhooks", "twilio", "status"]
            },
            "description": "`204` (también ante callbacks repetidos o de mensajes desconocidos). Sin firma → `403 \"Falta la firma de Twilio\"`; firma inválida → `403 \"Firma de Twilio inválida\"`."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Mock KIZUNA (solo local)",
      "description": "Mock de KIZUNA de docker compose. No se despliega en Producción. `MOCK_FAIL_TIMES=N` responde 500 las primeras N veces; `MOCK_RESPONSE_DELAY_SECONDS` simula un timeout.",
      "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Payloads recibidos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{kizuna_mock_url}}/kizuna/received",
              "host": ["{{kizuna_mock_url}}"],
              "path": ["kizuna", "received"]
            },
            "description": "`{\"total_requests\", \"received\": [{\"received_at\", \"payload\"}]}`. `total_requests` incluye los fallos simulados."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reiniciar recibidos",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{kizuna_mock_url}}/kizuna/received",
              "host": ["{{kizuna_mock_url}}"],
              "path": ["kizuna", "received"]
            },
            "description": "Vacía la lista y reinicia el contador (`204`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Enviar resultado (como el backend)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"IdentifierId\": \"{{transaction_id}}\",\n  \"customerId\": \"{{customer_id}}\",\n  \"dealerCode\": \"{{dealer_code}}\",\n  \"consentDateTime\": \"2026-11-02T13:35:00-05:00\",\n  \"personalDataConsent\": true,\n  \"marketingConsentYMDP\": false,\n  \"marketingConsentDEALER\": false\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{kizuna_mock_url}}/kizuna/consent-result",
              "host": ["{{kizuna_mock_url}}"],
              "path": ["kizuna", "consent-result"]
            },
            "description": "Payload propuesto en M5 (PENDIENTE-13). `200 {\"received\": true}`; estructura inválida → `422`."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
